# ESP-IDF build
build/
build_*/
sdkconfig
sdkconfig.old
managed_components/
# dependencies.lock IS tracked: main/idf_component.yml pins only led_strip,
# and the esp-homekit-sdk manifest leaves espressif/mdns unbounded, so without
# the lock a release build resolves whatever satisfies those ranges that day —
# the tagged binary would not be built from the component set that was tested.
# Regenerate deliberately (delete it, build, review the diff, commit).

# Auto-generated HTML headers (built from web/*.html by scripts/embed_html_idf.py)
include/

